# Keep acceptance receipt. The contextual catalog targets the focused member,
# the action persists graph truth, and the retained strip projects Kept after
# the same action spine completes. Offline; FRESH profile.
settle 30
key escape
open mere://keep-receipt
settle 10
assert snap kept == false
assert snap actions ~ Keep node

act Keep node
settle 10
assert event node-kept
assert snap kept == true
capture 01_browser_kept
log browser Keep receipt complete
